    <bpmn:process id="W_W3316" name="W3316. Employee Allowances, Reimbursements &amp; Flexible Benefits Administration" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Allowance policy; reimbursement request; flexible-benefit election
Frequency: Continuous
Volume: ~6,932 employees (allowances) + ad-hoc reimbursements
Owner: Compensation &amp; Benefits Manager
Participants: C&amp;B Manager, Payroll (links to VS-19.2/VS-34), Employees, Managers, Finance (links to VS-17.1)
Source: workflow W3316 — Employee Allowances, Reimbursements &amp; Flexible Benefits Administration</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3316_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3316_Lane1" name="C&amp;B Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3316_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3316_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3316_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3316_Lane2" name="Employees">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3316_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3316_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3316_Start4" name="Allowance policy; reimbursement request; flexible-benefit election">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3316_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3316_Task5" name="C&amp;B Manager administer allowance programs (transport, meal, communication…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: C&amp;B Manager administer allowance programs (transport, meal, communication, clothing/uniform, rice, COLA) per policy and statutory treatment; configure into payroll (links to VS-19.2) with tax-treatment (links to VS-79)
Responsible (R): C&amp;B Manager / Payroll
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3316_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3316_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3316_Task6" name="Employees submit reimbursements via expense process (links to VS-34.3/W74)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Employees submit reimbursements via expense process (links to VS-34.3/W74); Managers approve per authority matrix; Payroll/Finance process and reimburse with proper tax and GL coding (links to VS-17.1)
Responsible (R): Employees / Managers / Payroll
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3316_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
