        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: C&amp;B Manager design/maintain wellness, employee-assistance (EAP), and lifestyle benefit programs (gym subsidy, mental-health support, financial wellness, family support); integrate with occupational health (links to VS-83.3 EAP) and engagement (links to VS-103.2)
