        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: C&amp;B Manager operate the programs: vendor delivery (links to VS-34.2), utilization tracking (W3320), confidentiality (EAP privacy links to VS-91), and employee communication/promotion; coordinate referrals from occupational health (links to VS-83)
Responsible (R): C&amp;B Manager / Vendors
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3317_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3317_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3317_Task6" name="C&amp;B Manager measure wellness-program outcomes (participation, health-risk…">
