      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Employee life event (marriage, birth, adoption, death, illness)
Frequency: On event
Volume: ~hundreds of events/year across 6,932 employees
Owner: Compensation &amp; Benefits Manager
Participants: C&amp;B Manager, HRBP, Payroll (links to VS-19.2), Occupational Health (links to VS-83), Employees
Source: workflow W3318 — Dependent &amp; Life-Event Benefits Management (Maternity, Paternity, Bereavement)</bpmn:documentation>
