      <bpmn:userTask id="W3318_Task5" name="HRBP/C&amp;B Manager process life-event benefits: maternity (105-day expanded per…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: HRBP/C&amp;B Manager process life-event benefits: maternity (105-day expanded per RA 11210), paternity (7-day), solo-parent (7-day), bereavement, marriage, and adoption leave per policy/law (links to VS-19.2 leave); verify documentation and eligibility
Responsible (R): HRBP / C&amp;B Manager
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Per event</bpmn:documentation>
