        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: C&amp;B Manager/Payroll coordinate pay during leave (SSS maternity benefit per W3314, company top-up), dependent HMO adds (W3313), and statutory notifications; manage coverage continuity
Responsible (R): C&amp;B Manager / Payroll
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Per event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3318_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3318_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3318_Task7" name="C&amp;B Manager track life-event benefit utilization and compliance (Expanded…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: C&amp;B Manager track life-event benefit utilization and compliance (Expanded Maternity Leave, Solo Parents Welfare Act), report metrics, and ensure sensitive data privacy (links to VS-91)
Responsible (R): C&amp;B Manager
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3318_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3318_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
