      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Vendor renewal; performance issue; sourcing (links to VS-34)
Frequency: Continuous + annual
Volume: HMOs, brokers, insurers, retirement fund, EAP, wellness vendors
Owner: Compensation &amp; Benefits Manager
Participants: C&amp;B Manager, Procurement (links to VS-34.2), Legal (links to VS-100), Finance (links to VS-17.1)
Source: workflow W3319 — Benefits Vendor Management, Broker &amp; Provider Relations</bpmn:documentation>
