      <bpmn:userTask id="W3319_Task4" name="C&amp;B Manager/Procurement (links to VS-34.2) select and contract benefits…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: C&amp;B Manager/Procurement (links to VS-34.2) select and contract benefits vendors/brokers: RFP, due diligence, contract terms (SLA, data-protection per VS-91, fee), and authority approval; maintain vendor master
Responsible (R): C&amp;B Manager / Procurement
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: On selection</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3319_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3319_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3319_Task5" name="C&amp;B Manager manage vendor performance against SLA (claims turnaround, network…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: C&amp;B Manager manage vendor performance against SLA (claims turnaround, network adequacy, service quality), resolve issues, and conduct periodic business reviews; coordinate provider network adequacy across 200 store regions
Responsible (R): C&amp;B Manager
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3319_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3319_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3319_Task6" name="C&amp;B Manager/Legal manage contract renewals/terminations and transitions, ensure…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: C&amp;B Manager/Legal manage contract renewals/terminations and transitions, ensure continuity of coverage for employees, and report vendor performance and spend (links to VS-34.2)
Responsible (R): C&amp;B Manager / Legal
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3319_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3319_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
