    <bpmn:process id="W_W3320" name="W3320. Benefits Cost Modeling, Total-Cost &amp; Utilization Analytics" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual budget; renewal; executive review
Frequency: Quarterly + annual
Volume: Full benefits program
Owner: Compensation &amp; Benefits Manager
Participants: C&amp;B Manager, Finance/FP&amp;A (links to VS-17.4), BI (links to VS-28.1), CHRO/CFO
Source: workflow W3320 — Benefits Cost Modeling, Total-Cost &amp; Utilization Analytics</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3320_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3320_Lane1" name="C&amp;B Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3320_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3320_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3320_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3320_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3320_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3320_Start3" name="Annual budget; renewal; executive review">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3320_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3320_Task4" name="C&amp;B Manager/Finance model total benefits cost (HMO, statutory, retirement…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: C&amp;B Manager/Finance model total benefits cost (HMO, statutory, retirement, allowances, wellness) per employee and as % of payroll/revenue; project cost under renewal/program-change scenarios
Responsible (R): C&amp;B Manager / Finance
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3320_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3320_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3320_Task5" name="C&amp;B Manager/BI analyze utilization (HMO claims, EAP usage, retirement take-up…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: C&amp;B Manager/BI analyze utilization (HMO claims, EAP usage, retirement take-up, leave) by demographic/segment, identify cost drivers and opportunities (plan redesign, wellness intervention links to VS-83/W3317)
Responsible (R): C&amp;B Manager / BI
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3320_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3320_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3320_Task6" name="C&amp;B Manager report benefits total-cost, utilization, and ROI to CHRO/CFO; feed…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: C&amp;B Manager report benefits total-cost, utilization, and ROI to CHRO/CFO; feed into benefits budget (W3327) and total-rewards effectiveness (W3328); benchmark to market
Responsible (R): C&amp;B Manager
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3320_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3320_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3320_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3320_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3320_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-536 (ensure controlled execution — Benefits, Wellness Programs &amp; Statutory Administration (PA-102.2).) | - operational: analytics; operational: outcome measurement (W3328)
Owner: Compensation &amp; Benefits Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
